            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_warlock</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#Boss_N08;不能被打扰！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#Boss_N08; must not be disturbeds!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_intruders1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">穿长袍的？！杀了他们！&#10;把他们身上钱财拿走喔喔喔！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">the goblins speak in incorrect/stylized speech</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Robes! Kill them dead! Takes their shinies!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_intruders2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">杀了他们！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">intending: kill the intruders</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Makes them dead!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_cult_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哇？你怎么进来的？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">added a second line: in broken goblin speech: "do you think we don't know why you have come?"</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">WHA?! How dids you get in here?!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_cult_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">休想碰到我们的圣物！&#10;保护战利品！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You wills never get hands on ours fabled items! Protect the loot!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_cult_stageA1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">必须杀的妥妥的！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Do it rights this time!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_cult_stageA2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">给我弄死他们，马上！！！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">the goblins speak in incorrect/stylized speech</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I wants them dead… NOW!!!!!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_cult_stageB1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">白痴！我什么都要我自己来么？！[P=1.5]&#10;你的长袍将是我的战利品！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Idiots! Do I haves to takes care of everything myselfs?![P=1.5] Your robes will make a good loot!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_cult_defeat</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">为什么？！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Whys?!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_Vlad1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你来了！我忘记告诉你一件极其重要的事情！&#10;在矿山那边有着一片#Location_sw;，&#10;那里住着唯一能帮你见到#Boss_N14;的人，&#10;呃，如果我是你，我就会去试试。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">There you are! I forgot to tell you something of mind-shattering importance! On the other side of these mines lies #Location_sw;, where there lives a powerful count. He is the only one that can help you reach #Boss_N14;, so if I were you, which I am obviously not, I would go there.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_Vlad2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">想要通过这个矿井，你首先应该找到入口&#10;我蝙蝠般的灵敏感觉告诉我&#10;在悬崖的另一边会有入口的，[p=1.5]&#10;好了，我走了！玻璃咿咿咿！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">To get through the mines, I would recommend that your first priority is to find an entrance. My bat-like senses tell me it should be somewhere on the other side of these cliffs. Okay, I must leave you now! Bleigh!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_Vlad3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">玻璃咿咿咿！这并不难不是吗？&#10;现在，继续穿越矿山并去到#location_sw;&#10;[p=1.5]你就能找到那个人，他肯定会帮你完成任务的！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Bleigh! That wasn't very hard now was it? Now, continue through the mines to reach #location_sw;. -- There you will find the count, who will certainly aid you in your quest!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
