    <Worksheet ss:Name="POI">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_statue</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">一个上古时期曾经强大的部落…其族人的雕像。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The statue at the beginning of the level</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A remnant of the once-prosperous trollish civilization.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_eggs</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">世界是最大的煎蛋，呼之欲出！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">World's biggest omelett, coming up!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_history</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这上面说这个矿井是被某个曾经繁荣的古代部落制造的。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It's said that these mines were once carved out by trolls.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_tools</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看起来这个工具是在匆忙中被丢弃的。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Looks like these tools were abandoned in a hurry.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_brokenbridge</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">桥断了…[P=1]&#10;……此路看来不通。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The bridge is broken…[P=1]    ...Looks like a dead end.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_secret</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看起来摇摇晃晃的……</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It looks wobbly...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_brokendoor</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我很好奇这堆碎石的后有什么…[P=1]&#10;或许附近会有别的路。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I wonder what's behind all this rubble...[P=1]    Maybe there's another way around...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_hobbits</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看起来这俩孩子在只有一把小刀和一个平底锅&#10;的情况下成了这个8条腿怪物的牺牲品。[P=1]&#10;嗯那边似乎还有一个不怎么值钱的魔戒在他们旁边。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Lord of the Rings ref.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Looks like two children, armed only with a small blade and a frying pan, fell victim to those eight-legged monsters.[P=1] Ah, and there seems to be a worthless golden ring lying next to them.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_birdnest</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">就算他们拥有魔能，&#10;哥布林似乎还是处于食物链的底层。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A giant bird nest, with goblin bones in it.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Despite all their magickal powers, it seems that goblins remain at the bottom of the food chain...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_birdbanner</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看来是个粗略描绘的鸟。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Looks like a crudely drawn bird.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_PoI_goblinhole</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">他们住这洞里？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Do they live in these holes?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#MI_Text_lookout</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">!</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">!</Data>
          </Cell>
